  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.EOSIOOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to EOSIO -- the delegated proof-of-stake blockchain with feeless transactions (resource model), 4,000+ TPS, and WASM smart contracts. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens on EOS mainnet or sidechains. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add read-only EOSIO account CQL and verified CSharp walkthrough (f6e4f0b)\n- Generate and restore real EOSIO keys (90c30c1)\n- Integrate verified Antelope contract build and deployment artifacts (b7136c9)\n- Integrate verified EOSIO native storage conformance (bff1993)\n- Integrate verified EOSIO native storage lifecycle (901c82b)\n- Qualify EOSIO JSON transport through the live Vaulta balance API (cece2d7)\n- Read live EOSIO wallet balances without signing credentials (408c9a7)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.EOSIOOASIS",
